<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>I'm Tejesh Varma, Head of Growth at Hydrilla. Your account is ready, and you have {{ customer.credits_remaining | default: 100 }} credits to start with.</mj-text>
<mj-text>The fastest way to see what Hydrilla does is to make one model:</mj-text>
<mj-text>
  1. Describe an object, or upload an image.<br />
  2. Pick text-to-3D or image-to-3D in Studio.<br />
  3. Download the GLB, or keep it in a Workspace.
</mj-text>
<mj-text><a href="https://hydrilla.ai/app/studio">Open Studio</a></mj-text>
<mj-text>If something is unclear, reply to this email. A person on our team reads every reply.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Tejesh Varma,<br />Head of Growth<br />Team Hydrilla AI</mj-text>
